const LOGO_IMG="data:image/webp;base64,",LOGO_PARTS="data:image/png;base64,";
/* ================= title: hand-lettered "Stella" as a photographed neon sign =================
   The sign was traced from Stella's own handwriting and rendered as real neon (AI-assisted), then the wall was removed
   so only the light remains. It is split into 4 tubes (S / star / ella / a), each with its own behaviour:
   - pink tubes (neon gas) strike almost at once: a few faint ionisation flickers, an uneven stutter, then lock on
   - the white star (argon + mercury) strikes dim and lavender, then warms up to white over ~2 s
   - afterwards every tube has its own timer and its own kind of fault; "a" is the tired tube that acts up most */
